(The Dependency Rule) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
0 -21 Td
(Source code dependencies must point only inward, toward higher-level policies.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
0 -21 Td
(Nothing in an inner circle can know anything at all about something in an outer circle.) Tj
/F1 11 Tf
0 -21 Td
